  "note": "Independent re-judgment against RFC 2918 Section 4 ('Otherwise, the BGP speaker shall re-advertise to that peer the Adj-RIB-Out of the <AFI, SAFI> carried in the message, based on its outbound route filtering policy.') after adding emitPrePolicyAdjRIBOut in Reactor.exportFilterFromFacts (egress_inject_filter.go) for RFC 8671 Section 5.2 and updating doctor-check registration in runRIBPlugin (rib.go, commit 04c75f30c3). In exportFilterFromFacts, the added pre-policy Adj-RIB-Out observation reads facts/body without mutating body, facts, peer, export-policy evaluation (runEgressPolicyChainASN4), withdrawal handling, or the returned (suppress, override, follow) values. In runRIBPlugin, switching OnDoctorCheck to r.doctorCheck and registering two unresolved-next-hop DoctorChecks does not affect refresh dispatch, Adj-RIB-Out replay, or structured event handling. All eight tagged tests (four RIB unit roots, three reactor unit tags, and refresh-config-static.ci) and all other cited producers are byte-identical to the prior enforced audit, so enforced stands with all 31 code bindings preserved.",
